        "question_type": "single_choice",
        "question_title": "A sequence is defined by \\(a_1=1\\) and \\(a_{n+1}=a_n+2n\\) for \\(n\\ge 1\\). Find \\(\\sum_{n=1}^{20}a_n\\).",
        "question_instruction": "Choose one correct option.",
        "explanation": "\\(a_n=1+2(1+2+\\cdots +(n-1))=n^2-n+1\\). Therefore \\(\\sum_{n=1}^{20}a_n=\\sum n^2-\\sum n+20=2870-210+20=2680\\).",
        "question_audio": null,
        "time_limit_seconds": 30,
